      "content": "The lab just sent over the detailed breakdown of those spectroscopic scans. They're flagging a specific synthetic binder in the sky portion that wasn't even manufactured until after 1850. That's pretty significant for a 17th-century piece, isn't it? What's your take on how we should handle this for the auction?",
